Yes. I think so, yes.

28:03.600 --> 28:05.226
Here you go.

28:08.354 --> 28:10.982
Last time I was in a fight,
I was eight years old.

28:15.653 --> 28:19.824
Well, that makes you
even more of a hero, doesn't it?

28:19.908 --> 28:24.579
I just did what anyone would do.
— three people walked by the alley.

28:25.455 --> 28:27.040
What? — they saw me...

28:27.123 --> 28:29.417
But they just kept on going.

28:31.461 --> 28:33.671
You are a hero, sir.

28:33.755 --> 28:37.926
And don't let anyone
ever tell you differently.

28:38.009 --> 28:40.261
