— you're not staying behind.

30:44.677 --> 30:47.346
This was my idea.
— I'm capable of executing it.

30:47.430 --> 30:50.308
I owe them!
— what are you more concerned with?

30:50.391 --> 30:53.728
Killing the others
or getting our people off this island?

30:55.813 --> 30:58.232
This afternoon
you said you were our leader.

31:03.404 --> 31:05.281
